,760141409,760141413,760141426]},{"nodeId":760141402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":982599802,"text":"あのカニについて…","nextNodeIds":[760141403]},{"nodeId":760141403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":2424120970,"text":"はぁ、見た目は怖いけど、本当はすごく温厚な子なんだ。あの変な石もとれたし、前の性格に戻ってくれると思う。","nextNodeIds":[760141404]},{"nodeId":760141404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3761063850,"text":"でも、しばらくは閉じ込めて反省させないと。理由はどうあれ、あいつが悪かったことには変わりないし、小さいカニたちは傷つけられたんだから。","nextNodeIds":[760141405]},{"nodeId":760141405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1364670298,"text":"大盗賊レッド・ミラーに懲らしめられた、鏡に惑わされた悪いフェイの総督と同じだよ。どんだけ言い訳をしたって、結局は自分の行動でしか罪は償えない。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760141406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3485943506,"text":"あの奇妙な石について…","nextNodeIds":[760141407]},{"nodeId":760141407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3383940386,"text":"はは、あれは人の心を操る欲望{RUBY#[D]ツワドフスカ}の石さ。たしかヒディンバお姉さんがそう言ってたんだったかな。","nextNodeIds":[760141408]},{"nodeId":760141408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1067512826,"text":"コホン、と、とにかく、霜月のほうに落ちたでかい石と同じように、空から落ちてきたらしい。ま、もう飛んでっちゃったんだから、もう危険はないはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760141409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":688519618,"text":"ホラガイ団について…","nextNodeIds":[760141410]},{"nodeId":760141410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1659052266,"text":"#えっ？ホラガイ団のことが知りたいの？ま、{M#お兄さん}{F#お姉さん}はもう仲間みたいなもんだし、教えてあげてもいいよ。","nextNodeIds":[760141411]},{"nodeId":760141411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3414525970,"text":"#アタシたちは…そうだな、同じ道を歩む同年代の「助け合いの会」とでもいうべきかな。年齢で言うと、実は{M#お兄さん}{F#お姉さん}は入会資格ないんだけどね…","nextNodeIds":[760141412]},{"nodeId":760141412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1711225210,"text":"でも、ナシャタウンで助けが必要になったら、いつでも言って！アタシにできることなら力になるよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760141413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4241510434,"text":"さっきのおかしな人について…","nextNodeIds":[760141414]},{"nodeId":760141414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3634384922,"text":"ああ、あの紫色の祭司のこと？手を出してこないってことは、少なくとも今は敵じゃない。できるだけ関わらないようにしよう。","nextNodeIds":[760141415]},{"nodeId":760141415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":2861505874,"text":"好奇心は命取りになる。カーチャ姉さんも、霜月の変人たちにはできるだけ近づかないようにって言ってたし。アタシみたいな大怪盗でさえ、あいつらに捕まって月神の生贄にされるとこだったんだからね。","nextNodeIds":[760141416]},{"nodeId":760141416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4169051882,"text":"生贄！？","nextNodeIds":[760141417]},{"nodeId":760141417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1263683738,"text":"そうだよ。あいつら本当にイカれてて、いろんな人の血を…うーん、思い出しただけでゾッとする。この話はやめよう。","nextNodeIds":[760141418]},{"nodeId":760141418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":2852684170,"text":"アタシを捕まえたのが右も左も分からない小娘でよかったよ。いくつかお話を聞かせてあげたら解放してくれたんだ。でなきゃ今ごろ…","nextNodeIds":[760141419]},{"nodeId":760141419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3458643978,"text":"#べ、別にそこまで怖がってないんだからね。大怪盗が怖がりじゃ、やっていけないでしょ。ただ、あいつらにはなるべく関わらないほうがいいって、{M#お兄さん}{F#お姉さん}に忠告してるだけ。","nextNodeIds":[760141420]},{"nodeId":760141420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":712230922,"text":"あっ、そうだ、情報源について伝えるの忘れるところだった。霜月の子の件に関してはヒディンバお姉さんから聞いたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[760141421]},{"nodeId":760141421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":1121831306,"text":"ヒディンバお姉さんに用があるなら…まだナシャタウンの近くにいるはずだから、ちょっと聞けば、すぐに見つかると思うよ。","nextNodeIds":[760141422,760141424]},{"nodeId":760141422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":232233930,"text":"引退するって聞いたけど…","nextNodeIds":[760141423]},{"nodeId":760141423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":2749897802,"text":"え？ヒディンバお姉さんに会ったことあるの？引退の話なんて聞いてないけど…後で聞いてみないと。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760141424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1456333210,"text":"頼りになるかな…","nextNodeIds":[760141425]},{"nodeId":760141425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":3015911218,"text":"心配いらないよ。超頼りになるって、このマイテが保証する。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760141426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3156026706,"text":"さようなら。","nextNodeIds":[760141427]},{"nodeId":760141427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21903,"speakerName":"マイテ","textMapHash":2967100522,"text":"うん、気を付けてね。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7608201"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7608202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":4212292444,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7601417,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":